flowchart TD
    A([Launch application]) --> B[Read Top10 from local file]
    B --> C[MenuState: choose mode and difficulty]
    C -->|Start single or dual| D[Game.start: reset Snake and generate Food]
    D --> E[PlayState: running]
    E --> F{User operation or timer?}
    F -->|Direction key| G{Reverse of committed direction?}
    G -->|Yes| E
    G -->|No| H[Queue requested direction] --> E
    F -->|Pause P| I[Pause QTimer and game]
    I -->|Continue C| E
    F -->|Save slot| J[Validate state and write slot file] --> I
    F -->|Load slot| K[Read and validate all snapshot fields] --> I
    F -->|QTimer timeout| L[Game.tick dispatches PlayState.update]
    L --> M[Predict both heads before changing snakes]
    M --> N{Wall, self, other body or same-cell collision?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Determine winner and reason]
    O --> P[Update and persist Top10]
    P --> Q[GameOverState]
    Q -->|R: restart| D
    Q -->|Back to menu| C
    N -->|No| R[Commit deque moves simultaneously]
    R --> S{Did a snake eat food?}
    S -->|No| T[Update frame and repaint] --> E
    S -->|Yes| U[Grow snake and add 10 points]
    U --> V{Any free food cell?}
    V -->|Yes| W[Generate food on an empty cell] --> T
    V -->|No| O
    F -->|Esc| C
